'''Faster Run''' is a buff.
==First version==
The first version of this buff is granted by using the {{il|Smoke Mine}} skill. 

This version grants increased [[movement speed]] (the stat id behind is "base_movement_velocity_+%"). 

Players can also gain this buff indirectly via stealing (via [[HH]], etc.) the monster mod [[Modifier:MonsterModShroudWalker|{{c|mod|Shroud Walking}}]] (also known as "{{c|normal|Ambushes}}" the textbox that under monster nameplate), which is a rare monster-only mod. The mod automatically and periodically use Smoke Mine skill (monster version; internal id: [[Skill:NemesisDaemonSmokeMine|NemesisDaemonSmokeMine]])

Unique monsters may also having this buff by using their own version of Smoke Mine skill, such as [[Wiraqucha, Ancient Guardian]]'s [[Skill:MonsterSmokeMineSideArea|MonsterSmokeMineSideArea]], or [[Orcus the Reaver]]/[[The Broken Prince]]'s [[Skill:MonsterSmokeMine|MonsterSmokeMine]]. Note that [[Warband]] monsters' [[Skill:WbSmokeMine|WbSmokeMine]], does not grant this buff.

