There is a second version of this buff but have different status icon.<ref>Based on the datamined data from the buff with the internal id "sprinting" (numeric id: 4) in the "BuffDefinations.dat" of the game</ref> The source of this version is not yet confirmed. That status icon is also similar to {{stl|Tarred Ground}} or the flask effect icon from the suffix mod {{C|mod|#% increased Movement Speed during Flask effect}}, or the skill icon of {{il|Phase Run}}, or the buff from {{il|Victario's Flight}}.

Despite it has different graphical icon and descriptive text on the stat, this version also grants the same stat id: "base_movement_velocity_+%".

==Version history==
Before the removal of [[archnemesis mod]] and [[nemesis mod]] from spawning on the monsters, players can also gain this buff indirectly via stealing {{c|nemesis|[[Modifier:MonsterNemesisSmokeDaemon|Shroud Walker]]}} [[nemesis mod]] from the monsters. However, that mod is a legacy mod and partially reworked as "[[Modifier:MonsterArchnemesisAssassin|<span style="color:olive">Assassin</span>]]" [[archnemesis mod]] in [[version 3.17.0]] (went core and replaced old monster mod in [[version 3.18.0]] as a prefix known as "{{c|mod|Deadly}}", but still displayed under the monster nameplate as <span style="color:olive">Assassin</span>) which also became legacy in [[version 3.20.0]].

